Keys
Composer
  enter                run the task
  ctrl+j · \+enter     newline
  ctrl+e · ctrl+g      write the task in $EDITOR
  ctrl+s               stash the draft (again on an empty box restores)
  ctrl+c               clear the draft (↑ restores), then leave
  ctrl+l               redraw
  tab                  open setup
  shift+tab            switch Standard / Fast (this session)
  alt+m                open setup at the implement model
  !                    shell mode: run a command between Runs (ctrl+c stops)
  / · @ · ?            commands · files · this panel (on an empty box)
  ← → · ctrl+b ctrl+f  move
  home · end · ctrl+a  line start · end
  alt+b alt+f          move by word
  backspace · delete   delete back · forward
  ctrl+k · ctrl+u      kill to line end · start
  ctrl+w · alt+d       kill word back · forward
  ctrl+y               yank what was killed
  ctrl+_ · ctrl+z      undo
History
  ↑ ↓ · ctrl+p ctrl+n  earlier · later tasks (↑ on the first line)
  ctrl+r               search history (again: older)
  enter · esc          in a search: use the match · cancel
Menus & pickers
  ↑ ↓                  move in the slash menu or the @ picker
  tab · enter          complete a command · insert a path
  esc                  close it
  / · esc              in the Run picker: filter · clear it
  enter · d            in the Run picker: receipt · diff of a Run
  a · b                in the Run picker: apply · branch (confirm by typing)
  l                    in the Run picker: label the Run
Run
  ctrl+o               expand or collapse the progress
  ↑ ↓ · pgup pgdown    scroll it, expanded
  / · n N              expanded: search · next · previous match (enter jumps)
  { · }                expanded: previous · next Attempt
  esc                  close the search, then collapse
  ctrl+c               cancel the Run (twice: force Öge to stop)
Delivery
  ↓ on an empty box    the actions of the last Run
  a · b · d · r        apply · branch · diff · receipt (each ↓ allows one)
Setup
  tab · esc            close setup
  ↑ ↓ · enter          move · change the row
  s · w                save as default · write the project Checks
  d · x                remove the row
Vim (when enabled)
  esc · i a I A o O    NORMAL · INSERT (enter runs in both)
  h j k l              left · down · up · right (k, j at the edge: history)
  w e b                next word · word end · previous (NORMAL)
  0 ^ $                line start · first char · end (NORMAL)
  d c y                operator + motion or iw i" i( · dd cc yy (NORMAL)
  x · D                delete the character · to the line end (NORMAL)
  p · P                put after · before (the kill ring)
  v · V                select · select lines (then d x c y p; esc)
  u · .                undo · repeat the last change
Commands
  /help                              keys and commands
  /setup                             open setup (same as tab)
  /mode fast|standard                the mode of the next Runs (from setup)
  /agent <stage> <agent[@profile]>   bind a Stage's agent (from setup)
  /model <stage> <model>             a Stage's model (from setup)
  /effort <stage> <level>            a Stage's effort, Claude only (from setup)
  /runs                              recent Runs in this repo
  /receipt [run]                     the Receipt of a Run
  /diff [run]                        a Run's Candidate against the Snapshot
  /apply [run]                       apply a Run's Candidate to your tree
  /branch [run] [name]               a Run's Candidate as a branch
  /label [run] <text>                name a Run (yours; not Evidence); no text clears
  /export                            write this session's transcript to a file (redacted)
  /copy                              copy the last Receipt to the clipboard (redacted)
  /new                               start a fresh task
  /clear                             start a fresh task
  /notify on|off                     alerts for this session
  /terminal                          hints for this terminal (Shift+Enter, Alt keys, tmux)
  /resume                            not built yet (#55)
  /quit                              leave
